\cf2 Marshwiggle: I think, with platforms, we need to be more careful with the analogy. We use platform for the host of content for a reason. The analogy is not a bad one. But it should be recognized as such, and investigated as to whether it will bear the weight put on it - ideally, with a case made for and against the analogy being used in this way, and evidence weighed.\
